<v Ira Glass>《美国生活》由国际公共广播电台发行。

00:57:42.850 --> 00:58:16.990
<v Ira Glass>[FUNDING CREDITS]
<v Ira Glass>[资助鸣谢]

00:58:16.990 --> 00:58:21.240
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who has this advice for all our listeners--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚负责，他给所有听众的建议是——

00:58:21.240 --> 00:58:26.540
<v David Sedaris>If mashed with the right amount of force, a blow to the nose can be positively narcotic.
<v David Sedaris>如果用力适当，给鼻子一击可以产生积极的麻醉作用。

00:58:26.540 --> 00:58:30.600
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of this American life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多美国生活的故事回来。

00:58:30.600 --> 00:58:57.200
<v David Sedaris>Like was too feeble a word for what I felt. I loved it.
<v David Sedaris>“喜欢”这个词对于我的感受来说太无力了。我爱死它了。

00:58:57.200 --> 00:59:02.200
<v Announcer>PRI, Public Radio International.
<v Announcer>PRI，国际公共广播电台。
